166 ASTROLOGY FOR BEGINNERS 
BRANCHES OF ASTROLOGY 
The various branches of astrology are: 
a) Medical astrology or astro-pathology; 
b) Astra meteorology; 
c) Mundane astrology or Judicial astrology; 
d) Natal astrology; 
e) Harary astrology; 
i) Electional astrology; 
g) Kabala astrology; 
h) Kerala astrology; 
i) Omens
